:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T23:18:19-07:00","id":88689,"title":"","content":"ROFLMAO! Hooray PC interaction cock block! :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T23:20:26-07:00","id":88690,"title":"","content":"Also, werewolves are able to tell other werewolves, a werewolf can tell a wolf-blooded with a really difficult roll, I can't remember what it is though. From the description of the moot, I as a player am led to believe that anyone at the moot that isn't a wolf, is wolf-blooded, so I'm having Alex believe that at least. Even if it is wrong. LOL He's young.<br /> <br /> Also, I updated an image to use for Alex Price, and made it my avatar for now.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1033,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","user":"Lathcon","date":".  Didn't feel like making a new post. LOL 03-11-2014, 03:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T20:06:48-07:00","id":89199,"title":"","content":"Just thought I would be nice and include a little bit of a who's who. This is done from my phone so I apologize for the brevity and any typos.<br /> <br /> DJ Dirty Pawz- a Cahalith and pirate radio DJ who will frequently coordinate resources between the packs to fend off any incursions from the Pure or other beasties<br /> <br /> Abraham and his children Chloe and Clarke Cooke. Are all of the crescent moon and are hunters and jailers of particularly dangerous spirits. Abraham is the eldest wolf and is considered a leader amongst both his people. The uratha and the makah. He looks mid 80's but rumors exist of two centuries.<br /> <br /> Athena black. A rahu bone shadow being trained by the lone wolf. Train Wreck. The big lug you met outside.<br /> <br /> Ezekiel Clements. The young new moon who took over watch.<br /> <br /> Danica Kirkpatrick. A hunter in darkness who embraces the stereotype. While not a direct threat she often calls for nature to defend her.<br /> <br /> Chris Bridges. The bartender. An Elodoth of the Blood Talons. Has been rumored that he is responsible for negotiating a peace between all forsaken packs in the area.<br /> <br /> Miguel Hernandez. A bone shadow Cahalith and resident prophecy harbinger. Very charismatic.<br /> <br /> Dimitri Kristnov. A storm lord gibbous moon. He is wild and untamed and uses his tactics from his extreme sports careers.<br /> <br /> Lastly Gabriel Cartwright. A rahu's rahu. A blood talon. It has been rumored he has been in three packs and refuses to be a part of another due to bad luck and poor decision skills of his and his former pack mates. His territory is the calmest and many spirits obey the dictum because of the spirits he has brought down. Rumored membership in the Lodge of the Night","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2070,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","user":"DaWay","date":". 03-13-2014, 01:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014