dited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T00:08:18-07:00","id":92677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php\" target=\"_blank\"> Archived page &mdash; Umbral Echoes </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That right there is an online WoD dice roller. You can even put in our names and what actions we are taking, as well as 9 again and 8 again rolls! Not that I personally care, but it's a cool online system so that none of us can bitch and complain about the rolls you make, because we can see them for ourselves. It's also a way that WE can roll and YOU can see that we aren't lying about our results. <br /> <br /> Other than that I like your system, I was just letting you know about an alternative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https